# Riverfork Delta's otter sea cave (CIPlay riverfork_delta_caves, 11-08; in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its
# recipe: the mouth on the sea floor at 30 -102 (5 m down) off the east arm's mouth, the boulder cairn on the east bank
# at 27 -83, the flooded tunnel climbing to the dry den round 51.5 -59 (air zone rd_den, the seed tin). Swim in from the
# sea floor up the tunnel (no teleport into the den), breathe there, take the seeds, swim back out to the sea.
island Riverfork Delta keep
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm

# Outside: the cairn on the bank and the mouth from the water, the knoll on the beach
picture rd_cave_out 25 3 -80 30 -4 -100
picture rd_cave_mouth 28 -2.5 -110 30 -5 -102
picture rd_knoll 32 5 -66 51 4 -59

# Swim in: from the sea floor before the mouth up the flooded tunnel into the den, and breathe there
walk 28.2 -105.6 to 30 -102 to 38.5 -85 to 47 -68 to 51.5 -59 below=-3
air rd_den here

# The den: dry, air, the seed tin
picture rd_den_in 46 3.5 -70 53 3 -57
picture rd_den_out 53 3.5 -57 40 0 -83
picture rd_tunnel 39 0 -84 47 2 -68
open Seed tin
wait 2
expect item Seed_Mango 2
expect item Seed_Pineapple 2
air rd_den

# Back out: down the tunnel and out of the mouth onto the sea floor
walk 51.5 -59 to 47 -68 to 38.5 -85 to 30 -102 to 28.2 -105.6 below=7
